      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1906-02-03_WidnesExaminer_art0020" n="art0020">
        <head>LOW VITALITY</head>
        <p>LOW VITALITY</p>
        <p>developed, after a Chill, into a Critical Illness.</p>
